  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Humanitarian Core Activities 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Humanitarian&#x2019;s mission is to put quality, independent journalism at the service of the millions of people affected by humanitarian crises around the world. Its work contributes to more effective / accountable humanitarian action to improve the lives of those affected by crises by: 
I.	Informing decision-makers and practitioners in the humanitarian and related sectors 
II.	Providing accountability and transparency 
III.	Raising awareness among wider audiences 

Gender focus is integrated inThe New Humanitarian&#x2019;s work.</narrative>
  </description>
